config BR2_PACKAGE_FLYCAST
    bool "flycast"
    select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL2
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBZIP
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL
    select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBAO
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBMINIUPNPC
    depends on BR2_GCC_ENABLE_OPENMP
    select BR2_PACKAGE_GLSLANG		if BR2_PACKAGE_REGLINUX_VULKAN
    help
      Flycast is a multi-platform Sega Dreamcast, Naomi and Atomiswave
      emulator derived from reicast.

      Features:
      - OpenGL ES 2/3 or Desktop OpenGL rendering
      - Vulkan support (optional, requires glslang)
      - SDL2 for input/audio/windowing
      - ALSA for audio output (PipeWire compatible)
      - Netplay support
      - Per-SoC optimizations (RK3399, RK3568, RPi4/5, S922X, etc.)

      https://github.com/flyinghead/flycast
